<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\たき火.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\囲炉裏2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>A crowd of residents had gathered at my house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You could say it was everyone except the people of the Niimura main family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why had my house been chosen?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The answer was simple: my house was the closest to the Niimura main house.<PG>
All the same, it was an imposing sight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All the same, it was a menacing one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The natas and maces I had made were gathered here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the Noh masks and the red robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By our standards, you could truly call this battle-ready.<PG>
Someone had tipped off someone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That there was a witch here―<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
"Are you all really going to do this?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pressed them once again, stubbornly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Don't say that now. It's already been decided, hasn't it? Lost your nerve?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―That's right. If not now, when?<PG>
Once everyone's suspicion had fed on itself this far, it was really something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All this uproar, just because a <STYLE ID="1">girl</STYLE> with no ties of any kind to this settlement had come.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the most important thing―that <STYLE ID="1">girl</STYLE> supposedly had a danger-sense ability like <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-chan</STYLE>'s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, I never thought it would turn into something this big.<PG>
"But...! You've all lost your minds after all! Isn't this just curse-killing in the end!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―That's not it. The culprit isn't among us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Right. Not one of us is the culprit.<PG>
"Then who are you saying did the killing...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―They're here now, aren't they? That's why we kill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Don't tell me you're planning to betray us?<PG>
"............
{PAUSE ""}
That's..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A traitor is the witch's pawn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It's all to protect everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Shirozaki, you too―<PG>
Yes, this was the true nature of this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One for all, all for one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could such a selfish, self-serving interpretation be allowed?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The founder of this settlement could not have meant it that way.<PG>
Then was the best course for me to keep trying to calm everyone down?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was already settled: it would not be allowed anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I defied them, I would end up cut down by my own handiwork before <STYLE ID="1">that kid</STYLE> was.<PG>
"W-wait!
{PAUSE ""}
　All right... all right... There's no way I'd betray you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Can we really trust you?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Of course... You know who was curse-killed after <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-chan</STYLE>, don't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Fair enough. Now, let's go.<PG>
With that, everyone put on the red robes and the Noh masks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in their hands, natas and maces.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why go to the trouble of dressing like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would be easier to bring guns than weapons like these.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was to show our resolve.<PG>
It was the Niimura main family that had invited <STYLE ID="1">that girl</STYLE> here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, killing the <STYLE ID="1">girl</STYLE> meant defying the Niimura main family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And defying the Niimura main family meant defying the will of this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if everyone besides the Niimura main family rose up, that was another story.<PG>
This was a coup.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To show, as people of the Arata settlement, our will to protect this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
According to the ones who had been scouting, the Niimura sisters had gone out somewhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fighting with weapons like these, the biggest threat to us was those sisters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even all of us together would have a hard time taking on those two sisters.<PG>
I made up my mind as well, and put on the menacing gear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But did they really mean to storm the Niimura house without any real plan?<PG>
No, this showed that everyone's hearts were not as one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were radical ones like the ones just now, and there were conservative ones like me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not every single one of them wanted to kill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What would happen if you went against this tide?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Knowing that, they had no choice but to join in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, just like me.<PG>
Hey, <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ゆりこ">Yuriko</STYLE>, I'm in the wrong, aren't I? There's no way I should be doing this, is there?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You were the first one curse-killed. You'd understand, wouldn't you?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The idea that <STYLE ID="1">the girl from Motoki-cho</STYLE> is the culprit of the curse-killings...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸古い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\生け垣.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I went outside, everyone was hiding by the hedge.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had gotten into the bunch who had been so out for blood?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or had they lost their nerve now, of all times?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="なら">followed suit</STYLE> and crouched down beside them.<PG>
"What's wrong?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
―Quiet!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone's eyes were turned not toward the Niimura main house―
{PAUSE ""}
but toward the mountain path.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And at the end of it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A small figure was staggering toward the Niimura main house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE>, no doubt about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had happened to <STYLE ID="5">her</STYLE>, always so full of energy...?<PG>
As she came closer, the reason became clear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her face was pale, and she was drenched in cold sweat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And above all, a large wound on her back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could see blood dripping from it.<PG>
What? What happened?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE> was badly hurt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And at that rate, she wouldn't last long.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, as if chasing her, a slender figure appeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱鉈.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "40" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Was that <STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Holding a nata, and covered in blood as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That wound of <STYLE ID="5">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s had probably been made by a nata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if <STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> was holding that nata, then...<PG>
No, but even so, I couldn't just leave the two of them like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they didn't get treated right away, they would die for sure.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\生け垣.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, forget killing the <STYLE ID="1">witch</STYLE>, we have to save those two!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I said be quiet! Besides, this is our chance, isn't it!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Our chance?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Yeah. The two most troublesome ones are half dead. Better to kill them both together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Hey! Knock it off!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I grabbed <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="せ">Se</STYLE> by the collar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't see his face behind the Noh mask, but I could still tell his expression.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7" RUBY="せ">Se</STYLE> glared at me, his expression unchanged.<PG>
As an aside, there are four family lines in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
So there are four surnames as well, but most of them have split into branch families again and again, and people with the same surname often belong to different households.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Niimura family especially, since it represents the settlement, has split into branch families over and over, so that even with the same surname, the common ancestor is many generations back; they're nearly strangers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So there were people going by the name Niimura mixed into this group too.<PG>
The four family lines are as follows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura―the main family represents the settlement; they excel at martial arts and hunting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki―the line that makes weapons and tools.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8" RUBY="にいじま">Niijima</STYLE>―the line versed in farming and nature.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\生け垣.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
 this guy I had by the collar was <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="せ">Se</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His name was <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="せ">Masateru</STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="まさてる"> Se</STYLE>, and he was one year younger than me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="せ">Se</STYLE> family is the line that manages the water and the <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="かんがい">irrigation</STYLE> facilities.<PG>
In the second curse-killing, he had lost his much younger sister.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So he hated the culprit of the curse-killings all the more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, more than hating, I had a feeling that in his case, killing the culprit had become the goal in itself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ever since the watch on <STYLE ID="11">Kotaro-kun</STYLE> ended, he had suspected every resident.<PG>
It was thanks to him that I could stay conservative.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I let hatred drive me and thought of nothing but revenge, I would end up like him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thanks to that example of what not to be, I could still stay calm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But sadly, everyone had come around to his radical way of thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is precisely because my wife was killed that I can keep my self-control.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神手ぶら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, Ken-chan's riiight!
{PAUSE ""}
　There's no need to kill <STYLE ID="6">Chi-chan</STYLE>, let alone <STYLE ID="5">Kanakana</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The woman with this shrill voice was <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="にいじま">Kaori</STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かおり"> Niijima</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She talked like that, but she was older than me, nearly 60.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Back when <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-chan</STYLE> was a kid, she used to tease people with impressions of Kaori-san.<PG>
―Kaori-san, who in your family was curse-killed?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? My oldest son and my second son. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ma-kun, why are you asking that?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―They killed that many, and you don't hate the culprit? Two sons!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Buuut, let's save <STYLE ID="6">Chi-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Kanakana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
'Cause they're our fellow villagers, right?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "33" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Se shoved me aside, and the next instant,
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\鉈エフェクト.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "5" "200" "540" "1000" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "5" "200" "540" "1000" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\hit_axe1.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\生け垣.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神ハンマー振りおろし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
 he swung the nata in his hand in a great vertical arc.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\能面土下座.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "200" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPS>"Ah... gah-gah... Ma-kun... why..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>That faint voice came from under the Noh mask, and Kaori-san collapsed with a thud.
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n540\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hmph, you cursed woman. Die for Arata!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Se spat that at Kaori-san.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Hey, what are you doing!? That's enough out of you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I'm serious. Anyone who gets in the way is an enemy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "-200" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―That's right! Se's right!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "200" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―We should kill everyone in the Niimura main house!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―Follow Se!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3,人物4" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then everyone started marching straight toward the Niimura main house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's pathetic. I couldn't do anything more to stop them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I crouched down beside Kaori-san.<PG>
"Hey, Kaori-san, hang in there!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Nngh... Ken-chan..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Let me see the wound...!"
